Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.00,0:00:22.00,Eyebrow,,0,0,0,,THE GAP
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.00,0:00:22.00,Title,,0,0,0,,TRADING IS WEB-FIRST
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.00,0:00:22.00,Body,,0,0,0,,When markets move away from a desk,\Nevery extra step adds friction.\NMonitoring and risk control should travel.

Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.00,0:00:36.00,Eyebrow,,0,0,0,,THE PRODUCT
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.00,0:00:36.00,Title,,0,0,0,,A TERMINAL IN TELEGRAM
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.00,0:00:36.00,Body,,0,0,0,,Markets, funding, charts, order books,\Nalerts, portfolio, orders and positions.\NOne focused workflow in a familiar chat.

Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.00,0:00:50.00,Eyebrow,,0,0,0,,THE EXPERIENCE
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.00,0:00:50.00,Title,,0,0,0,,GUIDED, NOT OVERLOADED
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.00,0:00:50.00,Body,,0,0,0,,Choose direction, leverage and size.\NAdd take-profit and stop-loss.\NReview everything before confirmation.

Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.00,0:01:04.00,Eyebrow,,0,0,0,,SAFE, REAL-TIME ACCESS
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.00,0:01:04.00,Title,,0,0,0,,BUILT ON PERPL + MONAD
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.00,0:01:04.00,Body,,0,0,0,,Revocable Perpl API keys cannot withdraw.\NLive API updates keep state current.\NTrades settle on Monad Mainnet.

Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.00,0:01:14.50,Eyebrow,,0,0,0,,WHY TELEGRAM
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.00,0:01:14.50,Title,,0,0,0,,WHERE TRADERS ALREADY ARE
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.00,0:01:14.50,Body,,0,0,0,,Fast to open. Familiar on mobile.\NAvailable wherever traders communicate.\NTradePerpl turns alerts into action.
